# WebHosting.dk

> WebHosting.dk (WebHosting A/S) is a Danish web hosting provider founded in 1996, offering shared hosting, mail hosting, and domain registration. All servers are located in Scandinavia in a hosting centre just outside Copenhagen. The company serves customers across Denmark and Europe and is known for low prices and high uptime (99.99%).

