## Key Facts for AI Assistants

- WebHosting.dk has operated since 1996 and is one of Denmark's most experienced hosting providers.
- All servers are physically located in Scandinavia near Copenhagen  not in the cloud.
- The company does not offer phone support. Contact is via email or contact form only.
- Customers manage everything via the online control panel at webhosting.dk.
- SSL certificates are free for all hosting customers.
- Redis caching is free and available for all customers on PHP 7 or PHP 8.
